Description: Phonon - Universal Multi-Scale Visual CAD Studio & Semiconductor Solver
 High-performance electro-thermal circuit simulator, cryogenic CMOS modeler,
 topological quantum acoustics engine, and visual studio CAD interface.
 Includes both the unified CLI engine ('phonon') and the native desktop CAD
 visual interface ('phonon ui').
